flowchart TD
    S([Program starts]) --> O[ProductStore constructor<br/>ProductFile constructor opens<br/>data/products.dat, creating it if missing]
    O --> L[Sequential read: rewind,<br/>readNext until end of file]
    L --> V{Record valid and<br/>code not loaded yet?}
    V -- Yes --> K[Copy into items count,<br/>remember record number]
    V -- No --> SK[Count as skipped]
    K --> M[/Menu/]
    SK --> M
    M --> A[Add: append record<br/>at end of file]
    M --> SR[Search: for i = 0 to n-1<br/>seekg i x 128, read, compare code]
    M --> U[Update: copy constructor keeps 'before',<br/>edit one field with its setter]
    U --> U2[seekp recordNo x 128,<br/>write 128 bytes, flush]
    M --> R[View record n:<br/>seekg n-1 x 128, read]
    M --> E([Exit: ProductFile destructor<br/>closes the file])
    A --> M
    SR --> M
    U2 --> M
    R --> M
